# Settings for the web app. Not needed while developing: leave them unset.
# To use one locally, copy this file to apps/web/.env.local (ignored by Git). On Railway, set it in the web service's
# Variables instead, before the first build (Next.js builds NEXT_PUBLIC_ values into the pages).

# The game server's address, e.g. https://games-api.example.com (no slash at the end). When unset, the web app uses
# the address it was opened at on port 4000, which is right on this computer and for phones on the same Wi-Fi.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GAME_SERVER_URL=
